{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月13日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261113.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】近日接連有航空公司及商戶資料外洩，市民隨後懷疑被騙徒假冒客服詐騙，警方有甚麼打撃措施？市民應如何防範？</p><p>周五的《時事全方位》，請來警方代表探討。</p><p>題目：打擊及防範詐騙</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.079411+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:15:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T14:17:34.969678+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:27.688261+00:00","content_hash":"169c080ce523022417d6af2d4fd62b44e07b5ce5a6453404a8a3dbc225ef631f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}